Hi everyone:

I am running aroma.affymetrix on human exon array (HuEx-1_0-st-v2). I find a confusing thing about the gene summary:
trFit is identical to  ExFit.
My understanding is that if mergeGroups=TRUE, I may get a single value for each transcript. for every sample,
if mergeGroups=FALSE, I will get the exon value for each transcription for every sample, and I won't get a single value for the whole transcipt

plmTr <- ExonRmaPlm(csN, mergeGroups=TRUE)
fit(plmTr, verbose=verbose) # this takes a while!
cesTr <- getChipEffectSet(plmTr)
trFit <- extractDataFrame(cesTr, units=NULL, addNames=TRUE

plmEx <- ExonRmaPlm(csN, mergeGroups=FALSE)
fit(plmEx, verbose=verbose) # this takes a while!
cesEx <- getChipEffectSet(plmEx)
ExFit <- extractDataFrame(cesEx, units=NULL, addNames=TRUE) # this takes a while!

